# A Task subagent's work, folded under the tool call that started it
# (CLACKA-195): the card says what the subagent did last and how many
# tools it used, and opens to show its words and tools, indented.
size 1100x900
keys <C-;>:Agent claude<CR>
keys i
type task
keys <CR>
wait-for The parser is in src/parse.rs.
sleep 300
shot nested-turn-folded
keys <C-;>zR
sleep 300
shot nested-task-folded
click 500 177
sleep 300
shot nested-task-open
